<title>UK: National Grid up as Capel revalues Energis.</title>
<headline>National Grid up as Capel revalues Energis.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Grid Group Plc rose in busy trading after brokerage HSBC James Capel reiterated its &quot;buy&quot; stance on the stock based on a revaluation of the company's telecommunications unit, Energis, dealers said.</p>
<p>National Grid shares put on 10p to 267-1/2p and were the most actively traded stock by 0818 GMT with more than five million changing hands.</p>
</text>
